{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 23,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        54.185028076171875,
        237.7548828125,
        69.68902587890625
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.00768280029297,
        526.6842041015625,
        85.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "For infants aged <12 months old living with HIV, the GDG noted that preventive treatment should be given only",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.00768280029297,
        526.5862426757812,
        99.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "to those infants who have a history of household contact with a person with TB and do not have TB disease",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.00768280029297,
        526.628173828125,
        113.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "according to investigations conducted in line with national guidelines because of limited data on the benefits.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.00768280029297,
        526.6919555664062,
        128.11769104003906
      ],
      "text": "The GDG strongly recommended preventive treatment for children aged   12 months living with HIV, despite  ≥",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        129.0076904296875,
        526.6823120117188,
        141.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "the low quality of the evidence, because of the clear benefits seen in adults with HIV and the high risk for active",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        143.0076904296875,
        211.133056640625,
        155.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "TB among people living with HIV.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        162.67767333984375,
        526.599365234375,
        175.4776611328125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that, although the evidence for the efficacy of preventive treatment in children on ART is",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        176.67767333984375,
        526.7261962890625,
        189.4776611328125
      ],
      "text": "limited, it is biologically plausible, given the evidence of additive effects in adults with HIV receiving ART. Thus,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        190.67767333984375,
        448.63629150390625,
        203.4776611328125
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment is recommended for children, regardless of whether they are on ART.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        210.34765625,
        526.5980224609375,
        223.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "There is no evidence on the use of preventive treatment in children living with HIV after successful completion",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        224.34765625,
        526.6030883789062,
        237.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "of TB treatment. Like adults, however, children living with HIV who are exposed to reinfection and recurrence",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        238.34765625,
        526.6603393554688,
        251.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "of TB would benefit from preventive treatment. Therefore, based on this judgement, the GDG conditionally",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        252.34765625,
        526.664306640625,
        265.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "recommended that all children living with HIV who have been successfully treated for TB and are living in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        266.34765625,
        526.63525390625,
        279.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "settings with high TB incidence, prevalence and transmission (as defined by national authorities) should",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        280.34765625,
        526.6631469726562,
        293.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "receive a course of preventive treatment. Preventive treatment can be started immediately after the last dose",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        294.34765625,
        295.10009765625,
        307.14764404296875
      ],
      "text": "of TB therapy or later, according to clinical judgement.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.3052062988281,
        461.4068908691406,
        339.0882263183594
      ],
      "text": "2.3\t HIV-negative household contacts of a person with pulmonary TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        357.731201171875,
        490.421630859375,
        370.0052185058594
      ],
      "text": "HIV-negative children aged < 5 years who are household contacts of people with bacteriologically",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        369.7297058105469,
        509.38922119140625,
        382.00372314453125
      ],
      "text": "confirmed pulmonary TB and who are found not to have active TB on an appropriate clinical evaluation",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        381.72821044921875,
        503.587646484375,
        394.0022277832031
      ],
      "text": "or according to national guidelines should be given TB preventive treatment.  (Strong recommendation,",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        393.7267150878906,
        284.5451965332031,
        406.000732421875
      ],
      "text": "high-quality evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        411.396728515625,
        502.5606689453125,
        423.6707458496094
      ],
      "text": "In countries with a low TB incidence, adults, adolescents and children who are household contacts of",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        423.3952331542969,
        507.3524475097656,
        435.66925048828125
      ],
      "text": "people with bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary TB should be systematically tested and treated for",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        435.39373779296875,
        443.7976379394531,
        447.6677551269531
      ],
      "text": "LTBI.  (Strong recommendation, high–moderate-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        453.0637512207031,
        474.484375,
        465.48974609375
      ],
      "text": "In countries with a high TB incidence, children aged   5 years, adolescents and adults who are  ≥",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        465.062255859375,
        493.25164794921875,
        477.3362731933594
      ],
      "text": "household contacts of people with bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary TB who are found not to",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        477.0607604980469,
        499.53106689453125,
        489.33477783203125
      ],
      "text": "have active TB by an appropriate clinical evaluation or according to national guidelines may be given",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        489.0212707519531,
        488.24420166015625,
        501.3332824707031
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation TB preventive treatment.  (Conditional recommendation, low-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04522705078125,
        506.6913146972656,
        504.01995849609375,
        519.0032958984375
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  Appropriate clinical evaluation should include assessment of the intensity of and risk for exposure, the",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04522705078125,
        518.727783203125,
        412.42095947265625,
        531.0017700195312
      ],
      "text": "risk for development of active TB and/or ascertainment of infection by testing for LTBI.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        535.8859252929688,
        495.2295227050781,
        547.4058837890625
      ],
      "text": "Source of existing recommendation: Guidelines on the management of latent tuberculosis Infection. Geneva;",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        546.8839721679688,
        496.68280029296875,
        558.4039306640625
      ],
      "text": "World Health Organization; 2015 (http://apps.who.int/medicinedocs/documents/s21682en/s21682en.pdf).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.0670776367188,
        171.68173217773438,
        603.571044921875
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.8896484375,
        526.6712646484375,
        619.6896362304688
      ],
      "text": "We updated a systematic review conducted for the previous guidelines  , focusing on household contacts  (9, 10)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        620.8896484375,
        526.5962524414062,
        633.6896362304688
      ],
      "text": "in countries with high TB incidence. The aim of the review was to determine the prevalence of LTBI, progression",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        634.8896484375,
        526.662353515625,
        647.6896362304688
      ],
      "text": "to active TB disease and the cumulative prevalence of active TB among household contacts, stratified by age.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        648.8896484375,
        526.6552734375,
        661.6896362304688
      ],
      "text": "We added 19 studies published between 2014 and 2016. The evidence-to-decision and the GRADE tables are",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.90811920166016,
        662.8296508789062,
        194.55911254882812,
        675.7596435546875
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        662.8896484375,
        197.15609741210938,
        675.6896362304688
      ],
      "text": "presented in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.5596313476562,
        526.5992431640625,
        695.359619140625
      ],
      "text": "The prevalence of LTBI was higher among children and adolescents aged > 15 years and adults than in children",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.5596313476562,
        526.6471557617188,
        709.359619140625
      ],
      "text": "< 5 years, who were at greatest risk for progression to active TB disease. In comparison with child household",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.5596313476562,
        526.5843505859375,
        723.359619140625
      ],
      "text": "contacts < 5 years, the pooled risk ratios for progression to active TB were lower in children aged 5–15 years",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.5596313476562,
        526.6422729492188,
        737.359619140625
      ],
      "text": "(0.28, 95% CI 0.12;0.65, four studies) and for those > 15 years (0.22, 95% CI 0.08;0.60, three studies). All",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        738.5596313476562,
        526.6953735351562,
        751.359619140625
      ],
      "text": "household contacts, regardless of their age or LTBI status, were nevertheless at substantially higher risk for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        294.93609619140625,
        752.4996337890625,
        324.9091491699219,
        765.4296264648438
      ],
      "text": "Table 1",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.5596313476562,
        333.131103515625,
        765.359619140625
      ],
      "text": "progression to active TB than the general population ( ).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        549.6867065429688,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "11",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        171.12399291992188,
        796.524658203125,
        524.4039916992188,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "2. IDENTIFICATION OF POPULATIONS FOR TESTING AND TREATMENT OF LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}